OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 20, jailed after dashcam
OL,4,Afilmed 'horrific' head-on crash which
OL,5,Aleft victim with PTSD
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 20-year-old man who lost control of
OL,8,Fhis car and crashed head-on into
OL,9,Fanother driver has been jailed.
OL,11,FEthan Loveridge, from Llanbradach,
OL,12,FCaerphilly county, seriously injured
OL,13,FMartin Howells in the "horrific" crash
OL,14,Fin August 2024.
OL,16,FHowells, 50, suffered suffered eight
OL,17,Fbroken ribs, a broken nose, a detached
OL,18,Fbicep, injury to his left shoulder and
OL,19,Fa rotator cuff, and nerve damage to his
OL,20,Fneck and shoulder. He was off work for
OL,21,F10 months.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
